\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Sinners Jesus will receive;
\par Sound His word of grace to all
\par Who the heavenly pathway leave,
\par All who linger, all who fall.
\par \i 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Sing it o'er and o'er again:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men;
\par Make the message clear and plain:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\i0\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Come, and He will give you rest;
\par Trust Him, for His word is plain;
\par He will take the sinfulest:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Sing it o'er and o'er again:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men;
\par Make the message clear and plain:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Now my heart condemns me not,
\par Pure before the law I stand:
\par He who cleansed me from all spot
\par Satisfied its last demand.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Sing it o'er and o'er again:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men;
\par Make the message clear and plain:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men.
\par \i0 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Christ receiveth sinful men,
\par Even me with all my sin;
\par Purged from every spot and stain,
\par Heaven with Him I enter in.
\par \pard\li720        
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0\i 
\par Sing it o'er and o'er again:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men;
\par Make the message clear and plain:
\par Christ receiveth sinful men.
\par \i0\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
